      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-31",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This resolution calls on the people of the United States to remember the innocent victims murdered at Auschwitz, the Jews killed during the Holocaust, and all the victims of the Nazi reign of terror.&nbsp;The resolution also (1) calls on the people of the United States to continue working to end all genocide and persecution, and (2) recommits to combating all forms of anti-Semitism.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-03-07T16:42:20Z"
